  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatched in the toxic swamplands outside Subchain City, 'Rad' Riot was abandoned as a hatchling due to his tainted blood. Raised by rogue Ske8r rats, he learned to grind the wrecked streets and fight dirty for every scrap of DRIP he could find.",
    "class": "Riot Grinder",
